the batman brings a riddler to life in a  brutal new way courtesy of actor paul  dano who gives the villain a sinister  edge which brutal act is the worst of  the worst caution spoilers ahead  what is the price for your blind  the riddler begins as edward nashton a  former resident of an orphanage once run  by thomas and martha wayne bruce wayne's  parents when edward and bruce were  children thomas announced his run for  mayor of gotham city bertie and martha  were killed shortly afterward leaving  his promises of change unfulfilled in  the final act of the film the riddler  has been captured and incarcerated in  arkham state hospital burst has left  clues indicating he has one final act of  mayhem plan batman interrogates him and  learns that edward has held a grudge  against him since he was a child when  thomas and martha wayne were murdered  the public's attention was focused  entirely on young bruce this left the  orphanage forgotten whose terrible  living conditions edward describes to  batman in painful detail while edward  can't be entirely blamed for feeling  jealous of someone who lived in a  mansion while he'd suffered in a  run-down orphanage that's no excuse for  taking things out on an entire city  that's part of his plan to bring down  gotham city's elite and reveal their  darkest secrets the riddler cultivates a  large online following that is able to  carry out his mission even in the event  of his capture he does this by releasing  videos of himself committing crimes and  declaring his vengeance on the corrupt  rulers of the city this vengeance plays  out in full when the riddler is  incarcerated in arkham state hospital  when he's interrogated by batman he  reveals that he has placed car bombs  throughout gotham city the bombs go off  destroying gotham's breakwater walls  which causes considerable damage when  the city is flooded the sub-people is  all part of the riddler's scheme the  chaos acts as a distraction enabling his  cult-like followers to carry out the  assassination of mayor-elect bella  royale however with the help of catwoman  batman is able to take down the  riddler's fans and prevent the  assassination from taking place it's not  enough that the riddler enacts a large  number of heinous acts throughout the  film he also films them and releases the  footage to inspire gotham city's wayward  minds this elevates aridler from a  common criminal into a genuine monster  as mudbass carmine falcone's crimes  against the city are exposed the  catwoman vows to kill falcone who is  also her estranged father she takes off  for the iceberg lounge with batman and  gordon following closely behind when she  gets into falcone's office catwoman  points a gun at him but before she can  fire a fatal shot batman stops her he  turns falconi over to gordon and the  gotham city police department after he's  read his rights the penguin pulls out  again and prepares to kill falcone  himself but then falcone is shot dead by  the riddler instead who's in sconce in a  nearby building falcone is no angel  having committed plenty of crimes all  over gotham city over the course of  decades but this is one of many murders  riddler commits throughout the course of  the film given that it's simply a kill  with a gun actually makes it one of the  tamest the worst are yet to come i'm  just here to unmask the truth about this  at the point in time the batman takes  place james gordon has not yet risen to  the rank of police commissioner the role  he's most associated with as a character  instead the commissioner of the gotham  city police department is pete savage in  stark contrast to gordon's steadfast  morality savage is deeply corrupt having  accepted bribes from various criminals  shortly after mayor don mitchell jr is  killed by the riddler commissioner  savage holds a press conference he  announces the terrible news and promises  to bring the riddler to justice for his  crime however before he can carry out  this vow he's killed by the riddler the  villain leaves a message for batman and  releases a disturbing video of savage's  death to the public what makes this kill  so disturbing is how riddler does it by  trapping savage's head in a twisted maze  with some hungry rats distributing the  footage of the killing makes us an  especially cold-blooded crime  district attorney gil coulson is another  respected yet crooked member of gotham  city's elite batman discovers early on  that he's working for crime boss carmine  falcone however this doesn't make his  death at the ridler's hands any less  appalling during a funeral service for  the late mayor don mitchell jr a car  careens into the church where everyone  is gathered out comes colson who has a  phone attached to his hand and a bomb  attached to his neck bruce wayne who is  attending the funeral leaves then  returns as batman to talk to the riddler  via the phone in coulson's hand the  riddler threatens to set off the bomb  unless coulson can correctly answer his  three riddles with the batman's help  coulson manages to answer the first two  but he can't bring himself to answer the  third which would reveal the informant  to help the gotham city police  department bring down crime boss  salvatore moroni  the riddler proceeds to detonate the  bomb killing coulson and sending batman  flying backward so let's recap the  riddler ruins a funeral service for the  mayor he killed kidnaps and torments the  district attorney and then horrifically  murders him as if that's not bad enough  he also broadcasts the event live to his  growing online audience  the riddler's worst moment is also his  first brutally killing the mayor of  gotham city don mitchell jr on halloween  night it's a brazen way to kick off his  vicious campaign and he couldn't have  done it in a more cold-blooded way  shortly after watching news coverage of  mitchell's mayoral debate with bella  real the riddler sneaks into his home  and viciously beats him to death he  leaves mitchell's body propped up on a  chair with his head wrapped in duct tape  with the words no more lies scrawled  across his face to add to the  gruesomeness of this crime mitchell's  sum is removed and later found attached  to a usb drive in his car giving new  meaning to the phrase thumb drive the  drive contains photos of mitchell with  another woman revealing that he was  having an affair when batman and gordon  plug the drive in it automatically leaks  the photos to the media he kills a man  and then completely obliterates his  legacy and as you may recall his funeral  after the fact thanks to the riddler's  cruelty mitchell's wife and child don't  just lose him they lose their good  memories of him too check out one of our  newest videos right here plus even more  looper videos about the batman are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  you
 

